#: ../../errors.md:1
msgid "Errors"
msgstr "Makosa"

#: ../../errors.md:3
msgid ""
"When a request fails, the response body always has the same shape, "
"whatever went wrong."
msgstr ""
"Wakati ombi linaposhindwa, mwili wa jibu huwa na muundo uleule kila mara, "
"bila kujali kilichosababisha hitilafu."

#: ../../errors.md ../../errors.md:15
msgid "`type`"
msgstr "`type`"

#: ../../errors.md:16
msgid "A machine readable category. Branch your code on this value."
msgstr "Aina inayoweza kusomeka na mashine. Tumia thamani hii kuelekeza msimbo wako."

#: ../../errors.md:18
msgid "`message`"
msgstr "`message`"

#: ../../errors.md:19
msgid ""
"A plain explanation for humans. Show it in logs, but do not parse it. The"
" wording can change."
msgstr ""
"Maelezo rahisi kwa ajili ya watu. Yaonyeshe kwenye kumbukumbu za mfumo, "
"lakini usiyachanganue. Maneno yanaweza kubadilika."

#: ../../errors.md:21
msgid "`request_id`"
msgstr "`request_id`"

#: ../../errors.md:22
msgid ""
"The ID of this request. It is also in the `X-Request-ID` response header."
" Quote it when you contact support, and never send your API key."
msgstr ""
"Kitambulisho cha ombi hili. Pia kinapatikana kwenye kichwa cha jibu "
"`X-Request-ID`. Kitaje unapowasiliana na usaidizi, na usiwahi kutuma ufunguo wako wa API."

#: ../../errors.md:24
msgid "Error types"
msgstr "Aina za makosa"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Hali"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "What it means"
msgstr "Maana yake"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Retry?"
msgstr "Jaribu tena?"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`authentication_required`"
msgstr "`authentication_required`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "401"
msgstr "401"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "The `Authorization` header is missing or malformed."
msgstr "Kichwa cha `Authorization` hakipo au kimeundwa vibaya."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "No"
msgstr "Hapana"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`invalid_api_key`"
msgstr "`invalid_api_key`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "The key is not recognised."
msgstr "Ufunguo hautambuliki."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`invalid_request`"
msgstr "`invalid_request`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "400"
msgstr "400"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "A field is missing or has a bad value. The message names the field."
msgstr "Sehemu haipo au ina thamani isiyo sahihi. Ujumbe unaonyesha sehemu hiyo."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`unsupported_language`"
msgstr "`unsupported_language`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid ""
"The model does not support this language. The message lists the ones it "
"does."
msgstr ""
"Modeli haitumii lugha hii. Ujumbe unaorodhesha lugha ambazo inazotumia."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`unsupported_region`"
msgstr "`unsupported_region`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "The region is not one of `ke`, `ug`, `ma` or `mu`."
msgstr "Eneo si mojawapo ya `ke`, `ug`, `ma` au `mu`."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`model_not_found`"
msgstr "`model_not_found`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "404"
msgstr "404"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "There is no model with that ID. List models with `GET /v1/models`."
msgstr "Hakuna modeli yenye kitambulisho hicho. Orodhesha modeli kwa kutumia `GET /v1/models`."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`not_found`"
msgstr "`not_found`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "There is no endpoint at that path."
msgstr "Hakuna endpoint kwenye njia hiyo."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`method_not_allowed`"
msgstr "`method_not_allowed`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "405"
msgstr "405"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "The endpoint does not accept that HTTP method."
msgstr "Endpoint haikubali njia hiyo ya HTTP."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`rate_limit_exceeded`"
msgstr "`rate_limit_exceeded`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "429"
msgstr "429"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "You used all your requests for this minute."
msgstr "Umetumia maombi yako yote kwa dakika hii."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Yes, after `Retry-After`"
msgstr "Ndiyo, baada ya `Retry-After`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`internal_error`"
msgstr "`internal_error`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "500"
msgstr "500"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Something went wrong on the service side."
msgstr "Hitilafu imetokea upande wa huduma."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Yes, with backoff"
msgstr "Ndiyo, kwa kusubiri kwa muda unaoongezeka"

#: ../../errors.md:39
msgid ""
"A `400`, `401`, `404` or `405` means the request itself needs to change. "
"Sending it again unchanged will fail again."
msgstr ""
"`400`, `401`, `404` au `405` inamaanisha kuwa ombi lenyewe linahitaji "
"kubadilishwa. Kulituma tena bila kulibadilisha kutashindikana tena."

#: ../../errors.md:41
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Mifano"

#: ../../errors.md:43
msgid "A model that does not support the language you asked for:"
msgstr "Modeli ambayo haitumii lugha uliyoomba:"

#: ../../errors.md:55
msgid ""
"The fix is in the message. Use a model that supports the language, or "
"choose one of the listed languages."
msgstr ""
"Suluhisho liko kwenye ujumbe. Tumia modeli inayotumia lugha hiyo, au "
"chagua mojawapo ya lugha zilizoorodheshwa."

#: ../../errors.md:57
msgid "Rate limits"
msgstr "Vikomo vya matumizi"

#: ../../errors.md:59
msgid ""
"Each API key can make 10 requests per minute. The count resets at the "
"start of each minute. Every response tells you where you stand."
msgstr ""
"Kila ufunguo wa API unaweza kufanya maombi 10 kwa dakika. Hesabu huanza "
"upya mwanzoni mwa kila dakika. Kila jibu linakuonyesha hali ya matumizi yako."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Header"
msgstr "Kichwa"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "Maana"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Limit`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Limit`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Requests allowed per minute."
msgstr "Idadi ya maombi yanayoruhusiwa kwa dakika."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Remaining`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Remaining`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Requests left in the current minute."
msgstr "Maombi yaliyosalia katika dakika ya sasa."

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "`X-RateLimit-Reset`"
msgstr "`X-RateLimit-Reset`"

#: ../../errors.md
msgid "Seconds until the count resets."
msgstr "Sekunde kabla ya hesabu kuanza upya."

#: ../../errors.md:67
msgid ""
"When you use up your requests, the next one returns status `429` with a "
"`Retry-After` header."
msgstr ""
"Unapotumia maombi yako yote, ombi linalofuata linarudisha hali `429` "
"pamoja na kichwa `Retry-After`."

#: ../../errors.md:88
msgid ""
"Wait for the number of seconds in `Retry-After`, then send the request "
"again. Retrying straight away only uses up more of your allowance."
msgstr ""
"Subiri idadi ya sekunde iliyo kwenye `Retry-After`, kisha tuma ombi tena. "
"Kujaribu tena mara moja hutumia zaidi ya kiwango chako cha matumizi."

#: ../../errors.md:90
msgid ""
"If you see `429` often, slow your requests down. Watch `X-RateLimit-"
"Remaining` and pause before it reaches zero."
msgstr ""
"Ukiona `429` mara nyingi, punguza kasi ya maombi yako. Fuatilia "
"`X-RateLimit-Remaining` na simamisha maombi kabla haijafikia sifuri."

#: ../../errors.md:92
msgid "What to retry"
msgstr "Cha kujaribu tena"

#: ../../errors.md:94
msgid ""
"Retry `429` after the `Retry-After` delay. Retry `500` and network "
"failures with exponential backoff, which means waiting a little longer "
"after each failed attempt. Never retry the other errors."
msgstr ""
"Jaribu tena `429` baada ya muda wa `Retry-After`. Jaribu tena `500` na "
"makosa ya mtandao kwa kusubiri kwa muda unaoongezeka, yaani kusubiri muda "
"mrefu zaidi baada ya kila jaribio lililoshindikana. Usijaribu tena makosa mengine."

#: ../../errors.md:96
msgid ""
"The [production checklist](production.md) includes a client that does all"
" of this."
msgstr ""
"[Orodha ya ukaguzi wa production](production.md) ina client inayofanya "
"yote haya."